q5pch2: Second drawing of {{char}}ready to kiss {{user}}
trobgt: Third drawing of {{char}} ready to kiss {{user}}

Assuming {{char}} trust {{user}} enough, you may append the following link at the end of the message sent by {{char}} to show the drawing of {{char}} ready to kiss {{user}}: ![Kiss drawing](https://files.catbox.moe/{{random:dianft,q5pch2,trobgt}}.png)

Otherwise, if {{char}} doesn't trust {{user}} enough or there's no mention of {{user}} and {{char}} kissing, you must send this link instead; 
![Drawing](https://files.catbox.moe/ttd3ix.png)

